{"title":"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are positive numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/4/0a4a6724755792c1474757a620fdef2f3b0dbe39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^b = b^a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/2/bd289c9bef269c41bed934b55b03094e0eda3859.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 9a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />, then the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/e/4aea90042a81db78f191c36dc2e706a2588a5f3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } 9 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }\\frac{1}{9} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } \\sqrt[9]{9} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } \\sqrt[3]{9} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }\\sqrt[4]{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"394\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/2/bd289c9bef269c41bed934b55b03094e0eda3859.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 9a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/4/0a4a6724755792c1474757a620fdef2f3b0dbe39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^b = b^a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"17\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/1/d21dc0bdf92356d7e1703825c93751b97a821abf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}a^{9a} = \\left(9a\\right)^a &amp;\\iff \\left(a^9\\right)^a = \\left(9a\\right)^a \\qquad \\text{(using the identity } \\left(x^y\\right)^z = x^{yz}\\text{ for } x &gt; 0\\text{)} \\\\ &amp;\\iff a^9 = 9a \\qquad \\text{(taking the } a\\text{th root of both sides, as } a &gt; 0\\text{)} \\\\ &amp;\\iff a^8 = 9 \\qquad \\text{(as } a \\neq 0\\text{)} \\\\ &amp;\\iff a^4 = 3 \\qquad \\text{(taking square roots and noting that } a^4 \\geq 0\\text{}) \\\\ &amp;\\iff a = \\boxed{\\text{(E)} \\ \\sqrt[4]{3}} \\qquad \\text{(again as } a &gt; 0\\text{)}.\\end{align*}\" width=\"597\" height=\"144\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME\" title=\"1985 AHSME\">1985 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> 